\import{base-macros}

\p{\code{\verb~|core::simd~} gains \code{\verb~|shape_cast~}, \code{\verb~|bitcast~}, \code{\verb~|broadcast~}, \code{\verb~|transpose~}, \code{\verb~|shuffle~}, \code{\verb~|interleave~}, \code{\verb~|deinterleave_even~}, \code{\verb~|deinterleave_odd~}, \code{\verb~|slice~}, \code{\verb~|insert_slice~}, \code{\verb~|scalable_extract~}, \code{\verb~|scalable_insert~} and \code{\verb~|outer~}. Positions such as the order of a transpose or the picks of a shuffle are constant sequences, checked against the extents when the program is checked. See [operations on values](design-simd-vectors-ops). \pr{1005}.}
